@ExpenseControl_Api_Host = http://localhost:5293
@categoryId = 3feb665e-56c5-4251-bda6-d665dbda65d3
@transactionId = 0d958ff8-d43d-4e24-88fc-2fced1b62f12

### Health Check
GET {{ExpenseControl_Api_Host}}/health

### Prometheus Metrics
GET {{ExpenseControl_Api_Host}}/metrics

### Categories
GET {{ExpenseControl_Api_Host}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### Get Category by ID
GET {{ExpenseControl_Api_Host}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}
Accept: application/json

### Transactions
GET {{ExpenseControl_Api_Host}}/api/transactions
Accept: application/json

### Get Transaction by ID
GET {{ExpenseControl_Api_Host}}/api/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Accept: application/json

### Create Transaction
POST {{ExpenseControl_Api_Host}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "description": "Test transaction",
  "amount": 100.0,
  "date": "2025-06-27",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "type": "Expense",
  "notes": "Test note"
}

### Update Transaction
PATCH {{ExpenseControl_Api_Host}}/api/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Updated transaction",
  "amount": 150.0,
  "date": "2025-06-27",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "type": "Expense",
  "notes": "Updated note"
}

### Delete Transaction
DELETE {{ExpenseControl_Api_Host}}/api/transactions/{{transactionId}}

### Balance
GET {{ExpenseControl_Api_Host}}/api/balance
Accept: application/json

### Balance by Category
GET {{ExpenseControl_Api_Host}}/api/balance/by-category
Accept: application/json

### Balance by Month
GET {{ExpenseControl_Api_Host}}/api/balance/monthly
Accept: application/json

### Budgets
GET {{ExpenseControl_Api_Host}}/api/budgets
Accept: application/json

### Create Budget
POST {{ExpenseControl_Api_Host}}/api/budgets
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "year": 2025,
  "month": 6,
  "amount": 500.0
}

### Budget Usage
GET {{ExpenseControl_Api_Host}}/api/budgets/usage?categoryId={{categoryId}}&year=2025&month=6
Accept: application/json
